  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="8ebe9340-be21-5a2d-bf72-f9eb29ea5f9b" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Source events are complete snapshots; apply only a greater aggregate version.&#10;Commit ticket membership and queue/status counts consistently; all queries/cursors bind to one active generation.&#10;Expose checkpoint/freshness explicitly, rebuild from snapshot K plus retained events after K, and switch generations only after convergence.&#10;The ticket simulator is authoritative; there is no ticket authoring, deletion or full event sourcing.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
